  "attribution": "來源：《焦氏易林》，易學網《焦氏易林［四庫全書版］》（依據版本：《欽定四庫全書》子部術數類），https://www.eee-learning.com/book/giauii 。依來源要求標示出處及原網頁連結；本站僅整理林辭原文，並記錄收錄、標點及文字整理修改。",
  "entryCount": 64,
  "missingTargets": [],
  "entries": [
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 54,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 54,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 54,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 54,
      "hexagramName": "歸妹",
      "poemText": "堅冰黃鳥，常悲哀鳴。不見甘粒，但歡藜荊。數驚鷙鳥，為我心憂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:00ec3b6de01a29a5abca8aa238cff1f69bbef63fd54f8cd27aadfa46e594cb4c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b2f9d2ddcd62d6369e6343e814f2beac50c8887c2da266b2ca29428ac4364e7b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 54,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 1,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 1,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 1,
      "hexagramName": "乾",
      "poemText": "荊木冬生，司寇緩刑。威權在下，國亂且傾。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c54f6761a95480e6c3fbdf44ac4814f9ecfe702696b7ce66faa64b5bd7995e16",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f9ead4cbc470dc0c0af298e24bb585e547fd1938df682b27e533b9af2b47d046"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 54,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 2,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 2,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 2,
      "hexagramName": "坤",
      "poemText": "喘牛傷暑，弗能耕畝。草萊不闢，年歲無有。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:cce561bd7876c2bb710ab87e35635e30690e00f0f0b5aab31ac43ff0cfb04164",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:4f8dc780e48d36fd721dcd052052889f6ee13517c447438b77c98cfa57f323b9"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 54,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 3,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 3,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 3,
      "hexagramName": "屯",
      "poemText": "魚欲負流，眾不同心，至德潛伏。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:fcc6e1b86a173ebd958ba42539de6c0a6b33cca9ccb73f2ef23b8e022a6b678d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e1da59de4eb385dbf4c255a3ca50136b477c3ea151145506c4f4501603e9e7d6"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 54,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 4,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 4,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 4,
      "hexagramName": "蒙",
      "poemText": "春耕有息，秋入利福。獻豜大豭，以樂成功。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1a0f9be531c523570a3f01450f3d64de1a633a9aff8cdbaa1ade1860a5f83f19",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5bb7b3591c17b95d93afeb72170c03ce1c82a83d839df79b28bddc50acb39d1a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 54,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 5,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 5,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 5,
      "hexagramName": "需",
      "poemText": "生有聖德，上配太極。皇靈建中，授我以福。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ea89cbad3d7c588ef5fafdf531687b6485efa59163154b5f723b556120e10eab",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a20fed99e05c114170948f784ae43c873f98fa07010bfb877ad5da1ad220a0c2"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 54,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 6,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 6,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 6,
      "hexagramName": "訟",
      "poemText": "右撫琴頭，左手援帶。凶訟不已，相與相戾。失利而歸。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:59e9366b7cb7c2c3c5418575006908d7d396c099ce66ced886779409e7b3dfa7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d385370e070c2423a7d63da2ac4d87472b9cb36da5c5e4d27445a5385f7ac1fd"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 54,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 7,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 7,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 7,
      "hexagramName": "師",
      "poemText": "炙魚拈斗，陰倚碩鼠。舌不思味，譏發為祟。笮不得去。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d196384af86c92f04614490cde88f08fc6766ad7981ad0f7a8876f28baf83f70",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:8740839c6ea75a89f5c4fe940d2961efdbfa5e0799cc4eb8abcd1dcc3ed9a8fc"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 54,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 8,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 8,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 8,
      "hexagramName": "比",
      "poemText": "申酉說服，牛馬休息。君子以安，勞者得懽。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d17cd1d90cadb028bc4c12ccaaadfd1b3999b5d4bf0811f669f072aef46fc788",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:0817916dcee46c6677128b38ddc42177a65dbb6c86748a9e30d5c8c05cd7af25"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 54,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 9,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 9,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 9,
      "hexagramName": "小畜",
      "poemText": "堯門尹爵，聖德增益。使民不疲，安無怵惕。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d3d5bc02352922b9197399e77f2c548cf63f9a1fd7c8fc836a704db2dea6a549",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3f5a972f6c9828e77df1c44da2459e280d03a673b7e767e4cb770f3c8e0543a8"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 54,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 10,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 10,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 10,
      "hexagramName": "履",
      "poemText": "孤公寡婦，獨宿悲苦。目張耳鳴，莫與笑語。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:77d3200f6663f9dddfad4957ac95438f4ffa828de9612d4957ac85d237b8e916",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:57a03b0d89d5746ef2f95e77cda26540ff8f0525bfd1096b0106f5de6a7be30b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 54,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 11,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 11,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 11,
      "hexagramName": "泰",
      "poemText": "外得好畜，相與嫁娶。仁賢集聚，諮詢厥事。傾奪我城，使家不寧。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:b77bc06231cefcf9f29e88841cdcfb6e22fdea18bd6d081086220e654c763014",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3b54bd17f19d7a72b4498a4a15c125093ffe0c14cc416061789207ce8589bdfd"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 54,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 12,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 12,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 12,
      "hexagramName": "否",
      "poemText": "煎砂盛暑，鮮有不朽。去河千里，敗我利市。老手育馬，去之何悔。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4e190d72d543924b7edcafea275fe085f837e76daa31af248f1a19e3a845d8f5",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:7967860be8a23cd8abf51b9e737b7417ff4a6bb3c722dbcdc24c4388cb002ec3"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 54,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 13,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 13,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 13,
      "hexagramName": "同人",
      "poemText": "甲乙戊庚，隨時轉行。不失常節，萌芽律屈。咸達出生，各樂其類。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0bb20fe9e7d86f2aeb8de566f9c01a60d33593a60a116b99cee0aef5b7e546b6",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:543819c0337158456d6b88aa00fb75ce4c37113c7ce5e5a2dc18f88db4888c53"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 54,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 14,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 14,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 14,
      "hexagramName": "大有",
      "poemText": "依宵夜遊，與君相遭。除解煩惑，使心不憂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3866a7414648f541009c94d0413c080acebcf2d89b6881d87a86041ed6a12db6",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:0b2e8554009612a89345f2f334212abdb5697765c7abf22e84d27afd88e9260b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 54,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 15,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 15,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 15,
      "hexagramName": "謙",
      "poemText": "天有絕明，巧言為讒。覆白污玉，顏叔哀音。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:5b46f7383439d7f8da351a645f867a1d151646da9e50e91e89361a940b4fa72a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6eb13322780ec35e9a8d030389084541fe036a708c6a8b7a5ad0e4f8c2dd9b46"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 54,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 16,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 16,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 16,
      "hexagramName": "豫",
      "poemText": "逐利三年，利走如神。展轉東西，如鳥避丸。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:b12e0ba89579a6bb0edd4d0241ed8a6df98c333a45b5c074b67836057d6dbe64",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d5a6b567deb456ac8a30dfa615704ca7aa9b7c97b6963c79b77c82ce319803d2"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 54,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 17,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 17,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 17,
      "hexagramName": "隨",
      "poemText": "隄防壞決，河水泛溢。傷害稼穡，民流去室。君孤獨宿，沒溺我邑。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:880db8a065ea21a7613ef0f673057f9e63940d9e517f8edd4c6c043154eb77c1",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:7eefff503ccbe2af317eb936c49ba7d3fbdd977859ccff9c7f1f409d6e28cb79"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 54,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 18,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 18,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 18,
      "hexagramName": "蠱",
      "poemText": "陰陽隔塞，許嫁不答。旄丘新臺，悔往嘆息。晉之無妄）",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ddfb7abdbe977f895192322ed617e0f76c618e7690f3b95608993016a78c2c16",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:7098fcf2afff0a6d11e514936f9aae779ae86b49c3568ff4abe20916b78f31d6"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 54,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 19,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 19,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 19,
      "hexagramName": "臨",
      "poemText": "伯夷叔齊，貞廉之師。以德防患，憂禍不存。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8c2cc25c55b93eee112ad2add847e032dc948a6b2d675d0bd697484bb69b5bc1",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:78260c95cc8c3ad07b201a3259bd620299db12966d2d2aa4d9aab51fc9ea6943"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 54,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 20,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 20,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 20,
      "hexagramName": "觀",
      "poemText": "陽為狂悖，拔劍自傷，為身生殃。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:fbb61c0846cef5bc0d65b133ff6afae9d94a7e631d7108e1ac270fdd8d54ce0e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:931bc116fb0ca2e042fe7ef06a0bae86ac48b98cf5b43e6e89d2d6982b3accdf"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 54,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 21,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 21,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 21,
      "hexagramName": "噬嗑",
      "poemText": "進士為官，不苦服田，獲壽保年。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:98f07865f9983c9d9cb05918918abc1e93fcff794b5f20eb88cfbad09deeccb7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:16c25ce38589b7932e979bb54d9775ca3907d76a6f7d849f0250f3d9359de346"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 54,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 22,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 22,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 22,
      "hexagramName": "賁",
      "poemText": "耕石不生，棄禮無名。縫衣失針，襦褲弗成。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:95641eb429b4eab1f326e4a78c8d50a67bda284989bb98d28765085b74bf7dbc",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1661693a340aa339d045cf4597157734289ee7a4b55d62185b865a4e4c5a604a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 54,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 23,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 23,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 23,
      "hexagramName": "剝",
      "poemText": "靈龜陸處，一旦失所。伊子復耕，桀亂無輔。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6d9abbaeb4c49bf2ae3db15b70ddf6ceda70cf87ed01a703ab204c59b6c24214",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:91dce6ca7ffc9cce0e76841dd4726b5c457ddb3be87591f54cb16999ffcf7eaf"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 54,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 24,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 24,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 24,
      "hexagramName": "復",
      "poemText": "室當原口，漂溺為海。財產殫盡，衣食無有。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:2ca1ae10ecbfa9a2636621d6f21c10ceeb3c89293216566fb9069863d58f7f50",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f8d79d3f1f388b6ab1dd7a0fac9d9c7fe5f74ded7d81bffbfba5ccf111f842b6"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 54,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 25,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 25,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 25,
      "hexagramName": "无妄",
      "poemText": "雞方啄粟，為狐所逐。走不得食，惶懼喘息。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:b82ebc6967baed28a5fe96267c2c36f7f1276b36ff56d6477842f67a5068c509",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e892f494913d990fea73a5f4f02566ee03020c093f9aca181fd97f80a7ab98ea"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 54,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 26,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 26,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 26,
      "hexagramName": "大畜",
      "poemText": "家在海隅，繞旋深流。豈敢憚行，無木以趨。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:233b1836ee27d0b7d20ce7a2b832a5e739273159d9e8765d8a47d6197b5c1a0b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c78a83e119278b02167b095b86ddceef47a7fccac1a5eef89d8fbc83ad96f24d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 54,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 27,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 27,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 27,
      "hexagramName": "頤",
      "poemText": "他山之錯，與璆為仇。來攻吾城，傷我肌膚。國家騷憂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:b43b6dba585bbaf3bb31df157ca1a86f972013412b87d55528a076577835a990",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:87de75fa23433b5aa283291cdd94b0866c3acc1960232000b3f26fb22d1c8913"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 54,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 28,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 28,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 28,
      "hexagramName": "大過",
      "poemText": "弊鏡無光，不見文章。少女不嫁，棄於其公。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:aec0121d77a25c6f8268868d57b354ef5d637f2c638b48a8474204d1f3e7f54a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:127d91541bf110d7a4ccad0ac229b937190161c68b05dabf171a4f81326edaae"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 54,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 29,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 29,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 29,
      "hexagramName": "坎",
      "poemText": "大蛇巨魚，相輔殺之。君臣隔塞，郭公失廬。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:07f1e40ed3b7eef979e864bda082ffb34c986d18bf54b9ecc909f420e295e549",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:0eb43de65217f42165fdc42d194fe19097e9fb6f5f48b35b353c026a3631f3b0"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 54,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 30,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 30,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 30,
      "hexagramName": "離",
      "poemText": "絕世無嗣，福祿不存。精神渙散，離其躬身。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:dceea2dd0d5c609ac1ccfff568a34e3916f15d03fbf015126315421f5a37e19f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2663df3df3771d3500d9216a59fe0d5f442fa6055153e9db3ae88d64f4129103"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 54,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 31,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 31,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 31,
      "hexagramName": "咸",
      "poemText": "文君之德，養人致福。年無胎夭，國富民寶。憂者之望，曾參盜息。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:605d470fd5701a6c37645fcbc82f0d1db89cd8b227f1316d723773bbd893877d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a1cf941e92ac597e475f28e78bb23a2974ee0ca5fcaebf08394bbe9cd44263b6"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 54,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 32,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 32,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 32,
      "hexagramName": "恒",
      "poemText": "合歡之國，喜為我福。東岳南山，朝濟成恩。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:857627d40c389382756f5d16b40eb8e9ebaf5be4ccb4c2affc52c7721f5a05ce",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:eaa3e2334148e1600a458a237bf82e2d5d4fed62c853873996f537c6033669c3"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 54,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 33,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 33,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 33,
      "hexagramName": "遯",
      "poemText": "憂人之患，履悖易顏。為身禍殘，率身自守。與喜相抱，長子成考，封受福祐。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:db881ff6ab630541483bd5064a323317abf2431f7d8ff9703d13f20736636d74",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:7edabf2b605988dbeee8d97dcbb0e787202f330ca286394048432287c30e0fa1"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 54,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 34,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 34,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 34,
      "hexagramName": "大壯",
      "poemText": "太公避紂，七十隱處。卒逢聖文，為王室輔。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:b9a60fce40c660b714ac2dc4eabd3c048945d7181172e52515abb265f45bdce6",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:4d7689666c1dff684b437461dea2d51e33c478d9b840da2e503dda9c1f9cf9cc"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 54,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 35,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 35,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 35,
      "hexagramName": "晉",
      "poemText": "江漢上流，政逆民憂。陰代其陽，雌為雄公。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1aae95d7fa4752ed5697b34c38bfc487688174dcc840997fe0992bd9575ee9b8",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3a8650d4fb72c8f21f6499d3914610af98f30d14c464ea00be689236c6e687a9"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 54,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 36,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 36,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 36,
      "hexagramName": "明夷",
      "poemText": "縮縮亂絲，舉手為災。越畝逐兔，濡其衣褲。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:b5225cb37f5d380bb93e2e8dbad7cd4bfca59d30c62e109ceb882360135979bd",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:829037337eb5047678b279e87ff92d465af89a310a5a3501bce7343292969a25"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 54,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 37,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 37,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 37,
      "hexagramName": "家人",
      "poemText": "臭彘腐木，與狼相輔。亡夫失子，憂及父母。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4ace7423a868e3b80282e85c8c4aead7e179dd03ee3916a6704b8d6c38ec2a0e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6ef16fc404b201a633661b1ac50b588b6033b76effcd13b46d0256c7ea9d46f8"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 54,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 38,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 38,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 38,
      "hexagramName": "睽",
      "poemText": "刲羊不當，女執空筐。兔跛鹿踦，緣山墜墮。讒佞亂作。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:10f0c8a33411371225377377d62b878ce6a240583e287d42f83b997a57991bf9",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9bd5f42e427169ad74332eeed66243aceb20c0e7a4d3030a684c819274868cf1"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 54,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 39,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 39,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 39,
      "hexagramName": "蹇",
      "poemText": "拔劍傷手，見敵不喜。良臣無佐，困憂為咎。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:02086f4cf7de5dfcc2fbf5aea61437a2a9667e3b4fc553b9dcc381502f995e37",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:cbeae71c80e5a8aa500d27eaac1d0f08ff69cb82996a7d674f02cb8a297312d0"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 54,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 40,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 40,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 40,
      "hexagramName": "解",
      "poemText": "三羖五羊，相隨俱行。迷入空澤，循入直北。經涉六駁，為聽傷敗。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:929103a028325afd239d6b88294e8a082b0ee68cd20d099f8c5facf5efcd26c3",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ccd039860a5f64f9d043b603e22005a1a75ee7733530547b0f59e01bbd40a0d7"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 54,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 41,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 41,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 41,
      "hexagramName": "損",
      "poemText": "爭雞失羊，亡其金囊。利得不長，陳蔡之患。賴楚以安。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d5e96511e3300089d507b16ee5a35dcf0250b313912a57e4f2a47c1812b520fc",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:163635c5e3e558d1d50ea5f5e3fb8201250071e5b8826fab603c38b96e0edcf3"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 54,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 42,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 42,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 42,
      "hexagramName": "益",
      "poemText": "三灑負衡，南取芷香。秋蘭芬馥，盈滿神匱。利我仲季。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e8aa0943f10a30b9a957f6c4c6e369afbce0c5a6390f3612c09e0c45a4048f9f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:0428071ad49e2b99e16232fa1e1a8a18a21cedcb2a28eae06e82ed347cf9ec7c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 54,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 43,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 43,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 43,
      "hexagramName": "夬",
      "poemText": "孟春己丑，哀呼仲父。明德訖終，亂虐滋起。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:14fa9b2d83c28ebfab65c6cb879a23f50a01912c68f761a81b6f014b59458f32",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:51631ed79248831a8bc14aa67f80909fd75f707811ed107070c42c51504f4f65"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 54,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 44,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 44,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 44,
      "hexagramName": "姤",
      "poemText": "履不容足，南山多葉。家有芝蘭，乃無病疾。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7328d122fea9b7b61376b31770264d388bbeddeaad9645dd263c728231eec028",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e18874702fdd9329a9fdcc10636ff99683990e46a8cdafd0d0b6319d2de06ad5"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 54,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 45,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 45,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 45,
      "hexagramName": "萃",
      "poemText": "三足無頭，弗知所之。心在精傷，莫使為明。不見日光。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c6e72d47c23b8ff57a844c900497ae09ccb9e27fe542c0dbebe81ba8bf26baf2",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:df56b7f95914376299c80be508e1e51d66acfa8671843f2d42a8fb48ab042cbe"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 54,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 46,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 46,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 46,
      "hexagramName": "升",
      "poemText": "戴堯扶禹，喬松彭祖。西過王母，道路夷易。無敢難者。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:bdff44b60545f9a4b3eae2b2691b29c45db9c2b91b88037a2bb0d88626cd111d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b33bb0e980691ec5cf16d1ad5fc18e754c850fb0e18e59e0696341f4453969f0"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 54,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 47,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 47,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 47,
      "hexagramName": "困",
      "poemText": "式微式微，憂禍相半。隔以巖山，室家分散。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d350291406caf06b71b27be4c113ae1066ffb032da93d7654413f845ba006057",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:39801ce1f30b64b3d37c475b0f3224fd747f3d90249e84ee24ebd2401b59419e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 54,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 48,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 48,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 48,
      "hexagramName": "井",
      "poemText": "靈龜陸處，一旦失所。伊子復耕，桀亂無輔。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:31d5df6b7d9ac83e0643fc9c22160d2efae02f4b59e5bb52a7878a4d8cd0ebe9",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:91dce6ca7ffc9cce0e76841dd4726b5c457ddb3be87591f54cb16999ffcf7eaf"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 54,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 49,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 49,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 49,
      "hexagramName": "革",
      "poemText": "仁德覆洽，恩及異域。澤及殊方，禍災隱伏。蠶不作室，寒無所得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9c47095efac58749e55a0bd02fb751b29859368902bdcfaad1bdc35b9f5d27f9",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:75d3c7bd6ca469e53227aed84f9058ccedc208c0a670601fc9c13f3a7df2ebdd"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 54,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 50,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 50,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 50,
      "hexagramName": "鼎",
      "poemText": "夏麥，霜擊其芒。疾君敗國，使年夭傷。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7016afbaf9ce595eeb4c0a1829850f72489b3cfae54f972f4db2c6567c4604e1",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1c8d0088d2c220f835c0bcdd77bb19ecd1d6a0f0c200a8f062b9617c59ac64a4"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 54,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 51,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 51,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 51,
      "hexagramName": "震",
      "poemText": "火雖熾，在吾後。寇雖多，在吾右。身安吉，不危殆。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:baa2aa09b75f890a7d9f6ead992d53d33a5773df70aa75b17580a0e33f32a2d0",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:633436d769e7058c75910d88ff94e8beaeeb5b4bc7793d6aa57cd30e73c807db"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 54,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 52,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 52,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 52,
      "hexagramName": "艮",
      "poemText": "遼遠絕路，客宿多悔。頑嚚相聚，生我畏惡。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:08b2d552b5161b290d5b8a513894a085e70376af90b5a2800add8c2e9091e08a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e02abe1a2bc4c8c8033c96bc61248df0d013cab1a58ebecc3eebd003fd1d29d5"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 54,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 53,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 53,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 53,
      "hexagramName": "漸",
      "poemText": "懸懸南海，去家萬里。飛兔褭駿，一日見母，除我憂悔。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c24a2d7e7d358b4e79e439137d54594f11e9487f7f76032c8f47e3a85c628ab6",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:0c05f862f15f5f7ecec78ed82817d3d4476f1a3437feaa09924dd69a49408bf2"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 54,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 55,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 55,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 55,
      "hexagramName": "豐",
      "poemText": "因而後通，難厄不窮。終得其願，姬姜相從。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:347d0de74fa225e701490d5a3a0918ddb35f9bd644b1893e50616b3d78d5ee32",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:226cd3ff45f6c40da2e1a249c29228e5714f42265de5ad1b8008be211a723341"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 54,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 56,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 56,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 56,
      "hexagramName": "旅",
      "poemText": "西賈巴蜀，寒雪已沒。欲前不得，還反空室。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:551ca83451d6cf65902afe0e5e77103aa7d6e25aa819a4a604bbae41b68a5c55",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:156e29f8be19a28098bbce21515e093ebc9ed1ec57ec2dea97c70366f8afc391"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 54,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 57,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 57,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 57,
      "hexagramName": "巽",
      "poemText": "作新初陵，爛焰難登。三駒推車，躓損傷頤。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:abaff3ecc91559ced2b158cfc51c5ac4ffd96d4ce565e04ecbe9e4eb0484818d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:fe9c75be3bc9deeaa5eab5c438f457863bb9de49a036e25f49bcf75514c44843"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 54,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 58,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 58,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 58,
      "hexagramName": "兌",
      "poemText": "延頸望酒，不入我口。深目自苦，利得無有。幽人悅喜。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9a2323f9468848ae3a84d67eb0c6720a6043d92f9d0d191b22da674b6e97dba1",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:42def58f23785fd5e2901bc482633f8a8020b25e4c4d4041c0120a1ab2ffadab"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 54,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 59,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 59,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 59,
      "hexagramName": "渙",
      "poemText": "仲春孟夏，和氣所舍。生我喜福，國無殘賊。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9102d4dd79ba5cf32a6ee418ac57103d0e40af2b4b6a82871dff7f7fd411429d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:12ac9dc9a30f6c39f6b3a33f54b83b1c391f1021f0a0c2b0334b60d0a41286d6"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 54,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 60,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 60,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 60,
      "hexagramName": "節",
      "poemText": "張網捕鳩，兔離其災。雌雄俱得，為罝所賊。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3524187133f374911040813097ae0adc772044762c0609fbc7d188fc924d9009",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:03d9edfbb0396aac5cf3e50e929af3f89e3152f1f4a4a309e9bfdbcf61343da7"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 54,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 61,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 61,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 61,
      "hexagramName": "中孚",
      "poemText": "三人俱行，一人言北。伯仲欲南，少叔不得。中欲分道，爭鬥相賊。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8e4551734d80e379578638816aa85a52e75baa9e97cc75e5073903ba3dd55da5",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3d4bbbf21461047559c4679ab649d680ce6ed6965153b043fe803858d8a5ccfd"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 54,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 62,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 62,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 62,
      "hexagramName": "小過",
      "poemText": "然諾不行，欺紿誤人。使我露宿，夜歸溫室。神怒不直，鬼擊其目。欲求福利，適反自賊。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7e3782d6d9f7afc082d19cc0f602438a359cba9cce434aa4d9e1f37e9ec0eed9",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:133c607ee669224f59253e38c8f678cfd7302ca2ae444e149836a261afe5ecbb"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 54,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 63,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 63,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 63,
      "hexagramName": "既濟",
      "poemText": "陳辭達誠，使安不傾。增祿益壽，以成功名。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:470cef15f89dcc8138c47d96219356834110233ac457c588000a3b360c5e6674",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1c0a8c5fb7bf31b19f738610bffbacb4071fd0cb61bfee20964bafb7eae47915"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 54,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 64,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 64,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 64,
      "hexagramName": "未濟",
      "poemText": "火燒公床，家破滅亡。然得安昌，先憂後喪。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0fb509c290a5b2f72586e44855c79b65af02249e53ebf65f0ca0b58031a752c9",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:00ae8b736ce5e9b406ff35af3c4ce1b8cba1d14fcefc6c363ed89c3dc06e67b6"
    }
  ]
}
